# Dotfiles Doctor Overrides
# Lines here tell the doctor to skip specific checks.
# Format: CHECK_ID
# Example: skip "macos.reduce_transparency" if you want transparency on.
#
# To add an override: dotfiles-doctor --skip <check-id>
# To list all checks: dotfiles-doctor --list

# cbrwizard (off-VPN personal Mac, 32GB arm64)
# local-ai-warmup would auto-start LM Studio at login + every 30min.
# Per operator rule: local models must not run without explicit approval.
local-ai.warmup_agent_loaded

# Ollama is managed by Ollama.app on this machine (not the dotfiles plist).
# Plist is installed at com.dotfiles.ollama.plist.disabled for reference.
local-ai.ollama_agent_loaded

# Device management resets both power profiles to one template. Fighting it
# needs a root enforcer, so these checks are skipped. AC disk sleep has almost no effect on an SSD-only Mac.
# The writer is logged in ~/.local/share/dotfiles/logs/pmset-drift.log.
macos.pmset_display_sleep_15
macos.pmset_battery_sleep_15
macos.pmset_battery_disk_sleep_15
macos.pmset_ac_disk_sleep_10
